#X text 82 4948 One triangle MG for the instrument \, measured on a Poly-800 II. It also drives hmg \, pwm1/2 \, wsm and swm (DCO settings). More LFOs: LFO2 and LFO3 below., f 64;
#X obj 460 5032 s \$0-pdoly8;
