#X text 82 5062 mgr (-1): frequency in steps 0-15 as parameter 81 (0: 0.29 Hz / 3: 1.26 / 8: 5.2 / 15: 19 Hz) \, sets mgf. -1 = use mgf. \; mgf (5): the same in Hz., f 64;
#X obj 460 5152 s \$0-pdoly8;
